        "value": "Assessed gross yield (kusadaka) = 27,734.68338 koku. The two columns to its left give the breakdown: the 23,000-koku official assessment (高) plus 4,734.68338 koku of newly surveyed field (込高改出新田高). 23,000 + 4,734.68338 = 27,734.68338, exact. MASTER files 23,000 under this label; that figure is the sub-component, not the total."
